460
00:27:50.550 --> 00:27:51.500
Salamin.

461
00:27:58.390 --> 00:28:00.630
- Ano ang mali? - Sinabi mo bang ang pangalan mo ay Gook Gwan-woo?

462
00:28:02.940 --> 00:28:03.800
Oo.

463
00:28:04.160 --> 00:28:05.060
Busted ba tayo?

464
00:28:05.061 --> 00:28:06.560
Sabi ko wag kang magsusuot ng salamin.

465
00:28:10.760 --> 00:28:12.300
Nandito ba kayo para sa cram school or something?

466
00:28:13.150 --> 00:28:14.430
Bakit ka dumating na may dalang mga backpack?

467
00:28:15.680 --> 00:28:17.049
Mas higpitan mo ang ugali mo.

468
00:28:17.050 --> 00:28:18.760
Hay, pareho lang sana ang sasabihin ko.

469
00:28:19.850 --> 00:28:21.329
Kayong mga bata, pumasok kayo dali.

470
00:28:21.330 --> 00:28:22.190
Oo, sir.

471
00:28:25.900 --> 00:28:26.850
Seryoso.

472
00:28:27.960 --> 00:28:28.820
Hey.

473
00:28:29.890 --> 00:28:31.120
Paumanhin.

474
00:28:31.550 --> 00:28:32.870
Ito ay linggo ng pagsusulit pagkatapos ng lahat.

475
00:28:51.190 --> 00:28:52.050
ha?

476
00:28:53.750 --> 00:28:55.530
Ito ba ay isang uri ng malaking araw?

477
00:28:56.510 --> 00:28:57.370
anong mali?

478
00:28:57.930 --> 00:28:58.880
Nagkagulo ba tayo?

479
00:29:04.290 --> 00:29:05.080
Hay, pero...

480
00:29:05.081 --> 00:29:07.590
hindi ba ang nakatayong hukbo ay dapat magtipon para sa isang pangkalahatang pulong sa lalong madaling panahon?

481
00:29:08.260 --> 00:29:09.170
Ay oo.

482
00:29:12.460 --> 00:29:14.320
Pero hindi pwede ngayon.

483
00:29:15.140 --> 00:29:17.560
Sina Gook Gwan-woo at Jang Bi-hwan ay mga bastos.

484
00:29:18.380 --> 00:29:20.679
Uy, ito ang pakiramdam na ito ay magiging talagang mapanganib.

485
00:29:20.680 --> 00:29:21.839
- Dapat umalis na lang kayo. - Oo.

486
00:29:21.840 --> 00:29:24.070
Ito ay masyadong mapanganib.

487
00:29:24.820 --> 00:29:26.460
Hindi pwede. Dahil nandito na tayo,

488
00:29:26.920 --> 00:29:28.609
hanapin natin ang bagay sa lalong madaling panahon at pagkatapos ay umalis.

489
00:29:28.610 --> 00:29:29.629
Sumasang-ayon ako.

490
00:29:29.630 --> 00:29:30.889
Tinatamad na akong pumunta ulit dito.

491
00:29:30.890 --> 00:29:31.770
Pero...

492
00:29:59.450 --> 00:30:01.879
- Hee-won, maaari ka bang lumipad sa kaliwa at tumingin? - Oo.

493
00:30:01.880 --> 00:30:02.970
Syempre.

494
00:30:06.120 --> 00:30:07.990
- Mukhang may tao doon. - Oo.

495
00:30:08.800 --> 00:30:11.279
Nasa ikaapat na palapag sina Pi Han-wool at Choo Sung-woong.

496
00:30:11.280 --> 00:30:12.449
Magkasama ang dalawa.

497
00:30:12.450 --> 00:30:13.589
Pi Han-lana?

498
00:30:13.590 --> 00:30:15.579
Bakit nandito na naman ang lalaking iyon?

499
00:30:15.580 --> 00:30:17.049
Maghintay muna kayo.

500
00:30:17.050 --> 00:30:18.859
Dahil malamang nandoon ang kutsilyo.

501
00:30:18.860 --> 00:30:20.520
Hintayin niyo muna silang umalis.

502
00:30:26.080 --> 00:30:27.330
Nasa fourth floor kami ngayon. Tapos na.

503
00:30:29.160 --> 00:30:31.540
Oh, bumangon na sila. Humanda ka.

504
00:30:43.870 --> 00:30:44.960
Lumabas sila.

505
00:30:45.990 --> 00:30:47.840
Hintayin mo na lang na sumakay ng elevator ang mga iyon sa ibaba...

506
00:30:48.580 --> 00:30:49.440
ha?

507
00:30:50.660 --> 00:30:51.520
anong mali?

508
00:30:52.990 --> 00:30:53.920
Damn it.

509
00:30:56.890 --> 00:30:58.329
- Ano ang mali? - Ano?

510
00:30:58.330 --> 00:30:59.679
Bakit papunta dito ang mga lalaking iyon?

511
00:30:59.680 --> 00:31:02.349
Bakit hindi sila sumakay sa napakagandang elevator at sa halip ay papunta dito?

512
00:31:02.350 --> 00:31:03.210
ano sabi mo

513
00:31:05.380 --> 00:31:08.229
Sinabi ni Sun-chul bro na susuko siya
pagkatapos ng pangkalahatang pulong ngayon.

514
00:31:08.230 --> 00:31:09.340
Pinapaalam ko lang sayo.

515
00:31:09.870 --> 00:31:10.730
Oo.

516
00:31:18.710 --> 00:31:20.270
Mabilis na ayusin ang elevator.

517
00:31:22.530 --> 00:31:23.410
Paumanhin.

518
00:31:31.530 --> 00:31:32.390
anong mali?

519
00:31:34.230 --> 00:31:36.560
Akala ko narinig ko ang pagsara ng pinto sa bubong.

520
00:31:39.660 --> 00:31:41.629
Sino ang pupunta sa bubong sa ganitong oras?

521
00:31:41.630 --> 00:31:42.490
Magmadali at sumunod.

522
00:31:43.020 --> 00:31:44.159
Pero kung sakali,

523
00:31:44.160 --> 00:31:45.790
I'll go check and follow you kaagad.

524
00:31:52.030 --> 00:31:53.409
Hindi ang bubong, ang ikalawang palapag.

525
00:31:53.410 --> 00:31:54.640
Mga tanga kayo.

526
00:31:55.150 --> 00:31:56.719
Hintayin mo silang bumaba sa unang palapag,

527
00:31:56.720 --> 00:31:58.990
at aakyat na kami agad. Naintindihan mo?

528
00:32:01.670 --> 00:32:02.530
ha?

529
00:32:04.840 --> 00:32:06.100
Damn, anong nangyayari?

530
00:32:06.500 --> 00:32:07.440
Damn it.

531
00:32:07.870 --> 00:32:09.099
Hoy, Yoon Jiamin.

532
00:32:09.100 --> 00:32:10.630
Saan ka tumakas ngayon?

533
00:33:16.310 --> 00:33:17.170
ha?

534
00:33:24.220 --> 00:33:25.240
Naka-lock ba ito?

535
00:33:26.250 --> 00:33:29.720
(Deputy: Kim Sun-chul)

536
00:33:35.590 --> 00:33:36.450
hoy...

537
00:33:42.050 --> 00:33:45.050
(Standing Army Regular General Meeting)

538
00:33:57.050 --> 00:33:58.030
Sun-chul kuya.

539
00:34:22.730 --> 00:34:24.800
Naging parte na ng pamilya namin si Sun-chul bro.

540
00:34:27.180 --> 00:34:31.020
(Standing Army Regular General Meeting)

541
00:34:50.670 --> 00:34:52.050
Ito ay para sa mga gastos sa pananamit.

542
00:34:52.990 --> 00:34:55.350
Magagamit mo ito para tumulong sa mga bayarin ng iyong lolo, di ba?

543
00:35:07.980 --> 00:35:10.309
Sa lahat, huwag lang tumayo na inggit.

544
00:35:10.310 --> 00:35:11.750
Dapat binabati mo siya.

545
00:35:27.120 --> 00:35:29.369
- Bakit nandoon si Jiamin? - Damn it.

546
00:35:29.370 --> 00:35:30.910
Hoy, Yoon Jiamin, mag-isip ka!

547
00:35:31.290 --> 00:35:32.909
Pero...

548
00:35:32.910 --> 00:35:34.430
hindi bumukas ang pinto.

549
00:35:35.320 --> 00:35:37.600
Malamang kailangan mong pumasok ng mabilis ngayon.

550
00:35:38.180 --> 00:35:40.570
At bakit hindi mo kami sinundan sa halip na mag-isa kang pumunta sa bubong?

551
00:35:42.210 --> 00:35:43.070
Paumanhin.

552
00:35:43.610 --> 00:35:45.159
Huwag kang mag-alala.

553
00:35:45.160 --> 00:35:47.030
Ako na lang ang bahala sa misyon ni God Jiamin!

554
00:35:47.830 --> 00:35:49.470
Damn it mababaliw na talaga ako.

555
00:35:49.830 --> 00:35:50.870
Dahil umabot sa ganito...

556
00:35:51.800 --> 00:35:52.660
ha?

557
00:35:57.030 --> 00:35:57.890
Teka.

558
00:35:58.250 --> 00:35:59.270
Ano na ngayon?

559
00:36:00.460 --> 00:36:02.390
Yung mga lalaking pumasok kanina na may dalang backpack,

560
00:36:02.780 --> 00:36:04.669
pinangalanan ba silang Gook Gwan-woo, Jang Bi-hwan, at Seo Yoo-bi?

561
00:36:04.670 --> 00:36:06.439
Oo, ano?

562
00:36:06.440 --> 00:36:08.220
Hindi ba siya pumasok mag-isa kanina?

563
00:36:09.160 --> 00:36:10.040
Seo Yoo-bi.

564
00:36:13.490 --> 00:36:15.379
Bakit ang malas ngayon?

565
00:36:15.380 --> 00:36:18.019
Bakit nandito ang lalaking iyon ngayon?

566
00:36:18.020 --> 00:36:19.220
Huwag kang mag-alala, Ji-woo.

567
00:36:20.030 --> 00:36:21.150
Alam mo naman ang ibig kong sabihin diba?

568
00:36:24.580 --> 00:36:26.830
I'll let it slide that you tried to act cool today.

569
00:36:27.650 --> 00:36:29.300
Maghintay ka lang hangga't kaya mo.

570
00:36:30.560 --> 00:36:32.170
Sabi ko sayo wag kang mag alala.

571
00:36:35.670 --> 00:36:36.530
Lee Ji-woo.

572
00:36:47.450 --> 00:36:48.610
Joon, ingat ka.

573
00:36:49.130 --> 00:36:51.900
Sapat na ang masama kung magugulat kayong makita ako,

574
00:36:52.510 --> 00:36:55.139
pero nakasuot din ng uniform ng school namin?

575
00:36:55.140 --> 00:36:57.620
Noon ay nagkunwari kang numero unong ranggo,

576
00:36:58.950 --> 00:37:01.150
nagpapanggap ka ba na tumatayong hukbo ngayon?

577
00:37:01.720 --> 00:37:02.859
Napaka observant mo.

578
00:37:02.860 --> 00:37:05.539
Hindi ka pa ba nagigising tapos crush kita noon?

579
00:37:05.540 --> 00:37:06.609
Damn it.

580
00:37:06.610 --> 00:37:09.690
3 against 1 noon, hindi mo talaga matatawag na crush.

581
00:37:10.140 --> 00:37:11.289
Gayundin,

582
00:37:11.290 --> 00:37:13.169
ang kailangang gumising ay hindi ako, ikaw.

583
00:37:13.170 --> 00:37:15.210
Baliw ka ba, strawberry head ka? Damn it.

584
00:37:16.660 --> 00:37:18.820
Ngayon, na may kaisipang magligtas ng buhay,

585
00:37:19.360 --> 00:37:20.480
gagawin ko yan para sayo.

586
00:37:21.220 --> 00:37:22.220
Ah, ano nga ulit ang tawag dun?

587
00:37:23.570 --> 00:37:24.660
Damn it...

588
00:37:28.260 --> 00:37:29.549
Kaya mo yan! Kaya mo yan!

589
00:37:29.550 --> 00:37:31.070
Rehabilitadong tao!

590
00:37:31.470 --> 00:37:32.430
- Hee-won. - Ano?

591
00:37:33.670 --> 00:37:35.350
- Ayan... - Ano...

592
00:37:36.280 --> 00:37:37.140
Yung taong yun.

593
00:37:39.560 --> 00:37:40.420
ha?

594
00:37:44.200 --> 00:37:45.729
Nandito si Detective Na Tae-man.

595
00:37:45.730 --> 00:37:46.829
Kailangan nating kumilos nang mas mabilis.

596
00:37:46.830 --> 00:37:48.530
Kailangan nating maging mabilis bago maaresto si Sun-chul bro.

597
00:37:54.590 --> 00:37:55.600
Damn it.

598
00:38:00.300 --> 00:38:01.160
Damn it.

599
00:38:09.760 --> 00:38:10.889
Lee Ji-woo, nahanap mo na ba?

600
00:38:10.890 --> 00:38:12.170
Hindi pa nahanap.

601
00:38:31.050 --> 00:38:31.910
Natagpuan ito.

602
00:38:32.840 --> 00:38:33.700
Nahanap na?

603
00:38:34.150 --> 00:38:35.279
Kung nahanap mo na, lumabas ka kaagad.

604
00:38:35.280 --> 00:38:36.730
Ji-woo, bilis!

605
00:39:08.100 --> 00:39:10.030
Lee Ji-woo. Lee Ji-woo!

606
00:39:10.490 --> 00:39:11.120
Ji-woo!

607
00:39:11.121 --> 00:39:13.320
Bakit hindi sumasagot bigla si Ji-woo?

608
00:40:17.840 --> 00:40:18.700
babae ba ito?

609
00:40:21.140 --> 00:40:22.590
Ang cute niya.

610
00:40:25.010 --> 00:40:26.630
nakapatay ako ng tao.

611
00:40:44.080 --> 00:40:45.360
Ano ito ngayon?

612
00:40:56.670 --> 00:41:00.710
"Pangkat ng Pag-aaral"

613
